                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        We recently launched the
                        <a href="#">
                            Nutrition Care
                        </a>
                        website - Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.
                        Pita ala pesama borak na falanuisen.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

        <div id="footer">

            <div>
                <p>
                    Copyright © Enlighten Designs
                </p>

                <p>
                    Powered by Enlighten Hosting and Vadmin 3.0 CMS
                </p>
            </div>


            <div class="footer-right">

                <a href="#">About</a> -
                <a href="#">Services</a> -
                <a href="#">Portfolio</a> -
                <a href="#">Contact Us</a> -
                <a href="#">Terms of Trade</a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>